### GET request to read all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users

### POST request to create a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "aaaaa aaaaa",
    "role": "user",
    "email": "aaabbba@exemple.com",
    "mobileNumber": "a0123456789",
    "dob": "1990-11-11",
    "password": "abc123456"
}

### DELETE request to delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/69650ac2d4f7496c66727769

### POST login a user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/auth/cookie/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "aaabbba@exemple.com",
    "password":"abc123456"
}